      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A \"new\" shallow left anterior oblique view of the right coronary artery allows better visualization of the distal vessel in selected patients. This paper describes the angiographic technique; retrospective data suggest that the view is useful in approximately 20% of patients. An illustrative case is presented."},
